<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="cloak-for-blood-death-knight-tanking">Cloak for Blood Death Knight Tanking</h4>We're very limited in the Cloak department in <a data-entity="zone" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/zone=5892/dragon-soul">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Dragon Soul</span></a>. Ironically, our two best defensive alternatives don't come with strength, but with agility and intellect. I would by and large recommend using <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=77097/dreamcrusher-drape">
<img alt="Dreamcrusher Drape" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_cape_deathwingraid_d_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Dreamcrusher Drape</span></a>, but if you really want or need some additional defensive oomph at a big offensive loss, then you can use <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=71415/dreadfire-drape">
<img alt="Dreadfire Drape" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_cape_firelands_fireset_d_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Dreadfire Drape</span></a> or <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=77098/nanoprecise-cape">
