<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="defensive-trinkets-for-blood-death-knight">Defensive Trinkets for Blood Death Knight</h4>We get two new tanking trinkets in Dragon Soul, and both are fantastic for improving your odds at surviving an encounter. Unfortunately, there are no other alternatives that even get close, so you may have to use the LFR versions of these trinkets until you get lucky with drops.<br/>
<br/>
