<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="offensive-trinkets-for-blood-death-knight">Offensive Trinkets for Blood Death Knight</h4>While it's unlikely that you'll be using a DPS Trinket during progression on 25-man, a lot of players on 10-man should look to incorporate a DPS Trinket on at least a few bosses, even during progression. Switching 1 defensive Trinket for 1 offensive Trinket is about a 1.5k DPS gain, and if the boss you're fighting doesn't warrant a high health pool, then that's a good trade in my book. <br/>
<br/>Also, yes, you are seeing that correctly. <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=77999/vial-of-shadows">
