<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="weapons">Weapons for Blood Death Knight Tanking</h3>In <a data-entity="zone" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/zone=5892/dragon-soul">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Dragon Soul</span></a> we have one true BIS Weapon which may or may not be within reach. <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=78478/gurthalak-voice-of-the-deeps">
<img alt="Gurthalak, Voice of the Deeps" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_sword_2h_deathwingraiddw_d_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Gurthalak, Voice of the Deeps</span></a> from <a data-entity="npc" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/npc=53879/deathwing">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Deathwing</span></a> gives us almost a 2,000 DPS increase compared to the second-best alternative. A combination of the high item level and the somewhat broken damage from Tentacles of the Old One makes this the best weapon for all strength users in the game, so getting your hands on one may not be the easiest thing in the world. <br/>
<br/>You do miss out on some secondary stats, so if you are someone who doesn't care about offensive output, then there are two other alternatives in this raid for you. <br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Weapon Runeforge</b>: <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=53344/rune-of-the-fallen-crusader">
